      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-09-11_WidnesExaminer_art0036" n="art0036">
        <head>THREE CURED or VANCOSE ULCERS</head>
        <p>THREE CURED or VANCOSE ULCERS</p>
        <p>Lasted Three Months, Six Months and Three Years, Respectively— In One Case Even Hospital Failed —Doctors Treated All Three, One Prescribing Cuticura.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-09-11_WidnesExaminer_art0037" n="art0037">
        <head>CUTICURA IN EACH CASE A COMPLETE SUCCESS</head>
        <p>CUTICURA IN EACH CASE A COMPLETE SUCCESS</p>
        <p>"Some time ago I suffered from an ulcer which was caused by varicose veins. I was sitting, off my foot, for three months and had a physician -at- tending me, but the ulcer seemed to bo getting worse and was breaking out in another place. I was, however„ ad- vised to use Cuticura Soap and Cuticura Ointment by the physician. The ulcer gradually healed by using Cuticura Soap and Ointment and a perfect cure was the result. Ido believe that only for the Cuticura Remedies the ulcer would never have been properly cured. Charles Sparrow, 7, Virginia St., Bel- fast, Ire., May 8, 1208."</p>
        <p>"The part affected (with a varicose ulcer) was my foot, under the ankle- bone. I was under a doctor's care for six months when I met a lady who had used Cuticura Remedies. She advised me to try them. I then got a cake of Cuticura Soap, a box of Cuticura Ointment and a bottle of Cuticura Resolvent. The ulcer was quite raw and sore when I started with them, but I had not finished a second box of Cuticura Ointment or a second bottle of Cuticura Resolvent' when the sore was almost healed. It -broke out again in about a year's time and the Cuticura Soap and Ointment cured it. Mrs. Annie Sparrow, Lismore, Cross- doney, Co. Cavan, Ire., June 10, '08."</p>
        <p>• "I suffered with varicose ulcer for three years. I have been to hospital and doctors and did not get much bet- ter. Seeing the Cuticura Remedies ad- vertised I thought I would try them. After using four sets of Cuticura Soap, Cuticura Ointment and Cuticura Pills, the ulcer on my leg was quite healed. Mrs. R. A. Curry, 188, Crown&amp;ld Road, Stratford, Essex, Eng., Sept. 25, 1908."</p>
        <p>Complete External and Internal Treatment for Every Humour of Infants. Children and Adults con- sists of Cuticura Soap to Cleanse the Skin, Cuticura Ointment to Heal the Skin and Cuticura Resolvent Pills to Purify the Blood. A Single Set often Cures. Sold throughout the world. Depots:, London, 27, Charterhouse Sq.; Paris. 5, Rue de la Paix; Austra- lia, R. Towns dr Co., Sydney; So. Africa, Lennon, Ltd., Cape Town, etc.; U.S.A., Potter Drug &amp; Chem. Corp., Boston. el-Post-free from London depot. temple of Cuticura and book on the skin.</p>
      </div>
