      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-09-11_WidnesExaminer_art0062" n="art0062">
        <head>Domestic Servants, etc.</head>
        <p>Domestic Servants, etc.</p>
        <p>WANTED, GENERAL, aged 18 or 20.—Apply ANCHOR HOTEL, Blackburn. •</p>
        <p>WANTED, a strong young GENERAL, able to wash. —Apply to Mrs. PEET, 119, Legb at., Golborne.</p>
