      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-09-11_WidnesExaminer_art0121" n="art0121">
        <head>NOTICE TO CORRESPONDENTS.</head>
        <p>NOTICE TO CORRESPONDENTS.</p>
        <p>VERAX complains that the prizes for the Police Sports are nearly always purchased from the same firm. We feel sum o that the Police" Athletic Club can give a good answer to the complaint if they wish.—ED. "Ex."</p>
